🚀 AI-Powered Complaint Management System

A full-stack MERN application that uses AI to automatically categorize complaints, detect priority levels, and enable real-time complaint tracking with a role-based admin dashboard.

🔧 Tech Stack

Frontend: React (Vite), Axios

Backend: Node.js, Express.js

Database: MongoDB (Mongoose)

Authentication: JWT

Other: Multer (Image Upload)

✨ Features

AI-based complaint categorization

Automatic priority detection (High/Normal)

Secure JWT authentication

Role-based access (User/Admin)

Image upload support

Real-time complaint status tracking
